  "body": "When the dir attribute is auto, input elements in the Text, Search,\nTelephone, URL, and E-mail [sic] states have the same behavior as\ntextarea. They should have the same styling too.\n\nThis fixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=23054 which\nwas reported by @igortoliveira two years ago. For unknown reasons it\nwas never reported against the authoritative version of the HTML\nstandard.\n",
